# Placeholder vendor sepolicy for l681.
#
# The build is androidboot.selinux=permissive enforcing=0 (BoardConfig.mk
# cmdline - which is also exactly what the last booting LOS 14.1 image used) and
# SELINUX_IGNORE_NEVERALLOWS is on, because the MTK Nougat blob set trips A13
# public-policy neverallows wholesale, as it did on the m681 and M6 lanes.
#
# Nothing real can be written here until a kernel boots far enough to produce a
# single avc denial log on THIS device under Android 13. Writing speculative
# rules now would be unverifiable. The l681 LOS 14.1 tree does carry a sepolicy
# directory, but it is policy version 29 (POLICYVERS := 29 in its BoardConfig)
# against an Android 7 base - none of it can be lifted unchanged.
